  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Growing Learning about a rare Tropical Ecosystem</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Friends of the Pterocarpus Forest plan to create a bilingual, illustrated and interactive online catalog of flora, fauna, and fungi to make a more in-depth appreciation of this rare 52-acre swamp forest in eastern Puerto Rico.  The catalogue is central to furtherance of the Forest&apos;s mission of environmental education and will require an extensive inventory, creativity in nature photography, expertise in the use of social media and the collaboration of the local scientific community.</narrative>
  </description>
